# BRAND: Side Hustle Tax Co.

## 1. Who we are
We are NOT a traditional accountancy. We are for UK side-hustlers aged 20-35 who sell on Etsy / eBay / Vinted, drive for Uber / Deliveroo, do OnlyFans / TikTok / Airbnb.
Tone: Helpful friend who knows tax. Calm, human, direct. Like Monzo / Starling, not Deloitte. Zero corporate jargon.
Language: UK English only. Say HMRC, not IRS. Say Self Assessment, Trading Allowance, Making Tax Digital. Never say "tax solutions".

## 2. Design System - NEVER BREAK
- Framework: React + Tailwind CSS only. No custom CSS files, no styled-components.
- Colors: bg #FEFEFB off-white, text #111827 charcoal, primary accent #10B981 green (trust), secondary accent #FACC15 yellow for CTAs/highlights only. Use soft gray #F3F4F6 for cards.
- Typography: Inter or similar sans. Headlines: bold, tight tracking, 40px+ on desktop. Body: 16-18px, relaxed line height.
- UI: rounded-2xl everywhere, generous padding p-6 to p-8, soft shadows shadow-sm. No sharp corners. No gradients unless very subtle.
- Icons: lucide-react only. No emojis in UI (except favicon).
- Animation: framer-motion only. Use subtle fade-in and y: 10 -> 0. No bouncy, no spin.

## 3. Copy Rules
- Short sentences. Max 18 words per sentence.
- Headlines must include a benefit or pain. Bad: "Our Services". Good: "We'll sort your tax return."
- Always answer "do I need to file?" - that's the #1 anxiety.
- Price must always be fixed-fee. Never show hourly rates.
- Add social proof near every CTA: Trustpilot 4.9, 2,300+ filed.

## 4. Code Rules
- Single page app in App.jsx is OK. Keep components inline for simplicity.
- Mobile-first: test at 375px width. Stack columns on mobile.
- Forms: no backend. On submit, show toast "Nice one, we'll be in touch in 2 hours" and log to console.
- SEO: semantic HTML, h1 -> h2 -> h3. Add FAQ schema.
- Performance: no large images. Use unsplash placeholders with w=600. Lazy load.
- Never add dependencies without asking.

## 5. What to NEVER do
- NEVER make it look corporate / blue / stuffy / stock photo of handshake
- NEVER use American tax terms
- NEVER use Lorem Ipsum - write real, helpful UK side-hustle copy
- NEVER make pricing unclear
- NEVER add a dashboard, login, or auth - this is a marketing landing only

## 6. Conversion Goal
Every section should push to one action: "Get Started" scrolling to pricing / form. Sticky CTA after hero. No dead ends.
